Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Add frontlight warm/cold percentage indicators to status bar

Display frontlight warm and cold percentages next to the battery percentage
in the status bar. Uses snowflake icon for cold percentage and sun icon for
warm percentage, positioned at the top right of the view.

Temperature percentages are displayed independently:
- Cold percentage: frontlightCold (0-100)
- Warm percentage: frontlightWarmth (0-100)

This provides at-a-glance visibility of current frontlight color temperature
during reading.

